    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1086">

                <pb facs="1337" n="1325" xml:id="pg1325"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Austria)/5–1845:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Yugoslavia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Patterson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Belgrade</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-18T17:00:00+02:00">May 18, 1945—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>95. My 88, May 16. In compliance with Deptel 91, May 16, I sent Marshal Tito a
                    note rejecting his counter proposal on Austria at 7 p.m., May 17, an hour after
                    my British colleague sent his note of rejection.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Patterson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
